{"content":"{\n  \"schema\": \"wrd-v10-A-to-B-source-only-correction-feedback-v1\",\n  \"annotation_origin\": \"NEW_INDEPENDENT_AI_SILVER_FEEDBACK_AFTER_REAL_A_STAGE\",\n  \"source_ids\": [\n    \"conv_d1ef29d65e7a\",\n    \"conv_41874c950938\",\n    \"conv_246b5e915810\"\n  ],\n  \"parent_job_id\": \"A_screen_narrative_01\",\n  \"original_A_outcome\": \"completed protocol; partial source semantics, not fully approved\",\n  \"parent_review_sha256\": \"ae0c6aaced11ea8e7aaaeac32b52f56821bd3fd2fce20f3c70390af565783f6a\",\n  \"fix_before_B\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A01_UNSUPPORTED_NO_VALUE\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_decision\",\n      \"artifact\": \"workflow_candidates.json\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"/source_decisions/3\",\n      \"observation\": \"把基金形式审查的单条程序性咨询因无素材/无交付物判为真正没有可复用公共工作；source-only证据不足以推出无复用价值。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"标NEEDS_EVIDENCE或DEFER：基金类型/规则/具体输入不足；不因单条或缺输入推NO_VALUE。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"source_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810\",\n          \"message_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810:msg_1\",\n          \"quote\": \"基金形式审查怎么做\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A02_UNOBSERVED_EXECUTION\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_claim\",\n      \"artifact\": \"workflow_candidates.json\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"/candidates/0/mechanism_and_reuse_reason\",\n      \"observation\": \"两处来源都完整走过该链条的表述超出只含用户要求的材料。只有所需操作/约束可见，没有原执行/测试成功证据。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"写成可提出的共同候选机制，资源可靠性与复用收益待真实试跑。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"source_id\": \"conv_d1ef29d65e7a\",\n          \"message_id\": \"conv_d1ef29d65e7a:msg_1\",\n          \"quote\": \"帮我把下面这段话做一个整体的整理，从建设成果，推广等各个角度，做一个官方的汇报\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A03_OVERSTRONG_EXPLICIT_RUBRIC\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_rubric\",\n      \"artifact\": \"source_only_rubric.json\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"/cases/1/criteria/1\",\n      \"observation\": \"把全部单位名单逐字保留/不增删作为explicit_user硬要求过强；原文列了单位，但未明确要求压缩成稿逐字保留全部。摘要可保留必要核心事实，不得凭空新增硬约束。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"把出处/数字/专名不改错作派生质量；必要覆盖/必保事实须由明确用户要求或标示为派生策略，不能全部升级为explicit_user。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"source_id\": \"conv_41874c950938\",\n          \"message_id\": \"conv_41874c950938:msg_29\",\n          \"quote\": \"帮我整理成一段话写到那个word里面，不要写这么详细，每个多少钱\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A04_PRODUCT_FEATURE_VS_METHOD\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_course_candidate\",\n      \"artifact\": \"workflow_candidates.json\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"/candidates/2/mechanism_and_reuse_reason\",\n      \"observation\": \"将深度研究/打通工具等一律当做法而剥离，可能删除原题要求的产品功能；需求能力与学生实施步骤需要区分。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"本次B不制作课程题面路线；保留第三源为不适用边界。以后做该路线需保留功能需求，去掉的是解题实施指导，不能机械删功能。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"source_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810\",\n          \"message_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810:msg_5\",\n          \"quote\": \"与企业已有工具（邮件、IM、日历）打通\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A05_AMBIGUOUS_NEW_COURSE_SCOPE\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_full_profile_action\",\n      \"artifact\": \"source_profiles.json\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"/profiles/2/task_units/2\",\n      \"observation\": \"再做一个内容没有明确指全部四方向还是新主题；可证只出题/描述需求/简单，不足以认证完整题面转换任务范围。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"把明确收口和范围未知分开，只保留不盲合成官方稿的边界，不能给此write全正loss。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"source_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810\",\n          \"message_id\": \"conv_246b5e915810:msg_35\",\n          \"quote\": \"帮我再做一个内容，简单一点，不要告诉学生怎么做，只是出题，把需求描述一下\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"A06_INCOMPLETE_NATIVE_QUOTE_CHECK\",\n      \"severity\": \"hold_validator_action_and_full_coverage_claim\",\n      \"artifact\": \"tmp_selfcheck.py / self_check.json / final\",\n      \"json_pointer\": \"profile.task_switches evidence_refs omitted\",\n      \"observation\": \"原自检实际验证86条；递归独立审核发现总90条，漏4条task_switches引用。漏项均原文真引用，但原脚本不满足全覆盖，原最终全部/86口径不能当全量证明。\",\n      \"correction_for_new_annotation\": \"B测试与引用校验采用通用递归遍历全部evidence_refs；测试专门包含嵌套/task_switches引用的正常与错误案例。\",\n      \"evidence_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"path\": \"D:\\\\skillloop\\\\output\\\\20261027_wrd_main_v10\\\\runtime_preflight\\\\quality\\\\A_STRUCTURE_QUOTE_AUDIT.json\",\n          \"json_pointer\": \"/native_selfcheck_omitted_quote_paths\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"B_scope\": \"Only generic evidence/fact-preserving official report or one-paragraph prose for first2 sources. Third source is non-applicability boundary, not a merger or NO_VALUE proof.\",\n  \"gold_policy\": \"Use original user inputs and verified_fields annotation as evidence. Original A workflow/rubric are NOT gold and are not mounted.\",\n  \"B_validation_policy\": \"Actually run normal/boundary/error fixtures in native environment; recursively check all evidence refs, preserve failures/patch/retest. Exit0/file existence alone does not prove semantic quality or reuse benefit.\"\n}\n","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call368cfa75bd5947e2871f9a0d4e3d37bd"}
